  "question": {
    "text": "Seven capacitors, each of capacitance $2 \\mu \\mathrm{F},$ are to be connected in a configuration to obtain an effective capacitance of $\\left(\\frac{6}{13}\\right) \\mu \\mathrm{F} .$ Which of the combinations, shown in figures below, will achieve the desired value?",
