  "solution": {
    "text": "As required equivalent capacitance should be\r\n\r\n$C_{\\mathrm{eq}}=\\frac{6}{13} \\mu \\mathrm{F}$\r\n\r\nTherefore three capacitors must be in parallel and 4 must\r\n\r\nbe in series with it.\r\n\r\n$\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{eq}}}=\\left[\\frac{1}{3 \\mathrm{C}}\\right]+\\left[\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{C}}+\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{C}}+\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{C}}+\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{C}}\\right]$\r\n\r\n$C_{\\mathrm{eq}}=\\frac{3 \\mathrm{C}}{13}=\\frac{6}{13} \\mu \\mathrm{F} \\quad[$ as $\\mathrm{C}=2 \\mu \\mathrm{F}]$\r\n\r\nSo, desired combination will be as below:\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/nu9jxr82OLOA3ZBKmNjQL-ikthrbBl8LJhRmQhjColg.original.fullsize.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
